  "properties": {
    "title": "Discover PostGIS Functions with ST_Letters",
    "description": "Get to know the ST_Letters function that allows you to visualize the results of PostGIS functions with letters. ST_Letters renders a string as a multipolygon geometry. It is fun to use the function to experiment with PostGIS functions. Get to knwo how it works.",
